<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>mattbbs.com</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: white;
      min-height: 100%;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: black;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      min-height: 100vh;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 20px 20px;
    }

    .content {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 980px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      flex: 1;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 10px 0 18px;
      font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 72px);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.05;
    }

    .quote {
      margin: 0 0 34px;
      font-size: clamp(16px, 2.3vw, 22px);
      line-height: 1.5;
      max-width: 900px;
    }

    .image-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    img {
      width: min(760px, 92vw);
      height: auto;
      display: block;
    }

    .footer {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 28px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: gray;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="content">
    <h1>mattbbs.com</h1>
    <div class="quote">
      "it not about how many times we down bad, but how we decide to get up twin." -mattbbs
    </div>
    <div class="image-wrap">
      <img src="peter.webp" alt="Peter falling down the stairs">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">© 2026 mattbbs. All rights reserved.</div>
</body>
</html>
